  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nequation = (x + 2) (2x + 5)(x - 4) + x2 + 5x - 12.\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n= (x + 2) (2x + 5)(x - 4) + x2 + 5x - 12.\n\n= (2x² + 4x + 5x + 10)(x - 4) + x2 + 5x - 12.\n\n= (2x² + 9 x +10)(x - 4) + x2 + 5x - 12.\n\n= (2x³ + 9x² + 10x - 8x²- 36x - 40) + x2 + 5x - 12\n\n= (2x3 + x2 - 26x - 40) +(x2 + 5x - 12)\n\n= 2x3 + 2x2 - 21x - 52.\n\n**Hence, the correct answer is *'2*x3 + 2x2 - 21x - 52'*.***",
